# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Cloudflare's redirect parser flags the bare `/*  /index.html  200` rule
# with an "infinite loop detected" warning and drops it — it can't tell
# that index.html itself is a real file served before redirects fire. Being
# explicit about asset paths (which Cloudflare serves directly anyway)
# defuses the parser so the SPA fallback below actually registers.
#
# Order matters: assets first, fallback last.
/assets/*       /assets/:splat       200
/favicon.ico    /favicon.ico         200
/robots.txt     /robots.txt          200

# Everything else is React Router territory.
/*              /index.html          200
